      },
      {
        "author_name": "Jane Wilkins",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105523335624192308957/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKgssISiHiksisTdJuQGIcJXfCD-uks8Uox22GtBL2v3e35Cg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 1,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Just completed a 5 week water colour painting class and it was awful. My fault for not researching the class before signing up, but the teacher was terrible! All she did was paint her own project in front of the class and critique her own  work. Unspiring projects, terrible teacher, miserable set-up without even a sink for fresh water or to clean brushes. I'd put a zero star if there was that option,  was like throwing away $300!",
        "time": 1731850879,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Claire Frechette",
